-- Migration v6.7 — engines of the models added in v66, from the market
--
-- Built once from the Standvirtual market snapshot of 2026-11-13, the same
-- way as v61: the listings of each model were grouped by fuel, engine size and
-- power, and the most-listed groups became rows. 487 engines for 201 models.
--
--   fuel, displacement, power, gearbox, years   measured: the listings of that variant
--                                               (listings_seen says how many)
--   CO2, consumption                            measured where listing pages state the
--                                               car's CO2; otherwise estimated, or left
--                                               empty; electric: WLTP kWh/100 km
--   reliability_score, maintenance_cost_year    ESTIMATES on the scale of the brand's
--                                               other engines; v68 then anchors the
--                                               reliability on published studies
--
-- `source` records which of these applies to the row. Rows the database's
-- constraints would refuse were left out when this file was generated.
--
-- Idempotent: an engine is inserted only if its model has no engine of that code.

